{"id": "3291711", "name": "פונקציה סתומה – מישור משיק ונגזרת מעורבת", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "functions": [{"name": "coef", "params": ["i", "j", "k"], "body": "coeff(coeff(coeff(Fraw,x,i),y,j),z,k)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה המשוואה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle {{CT:0}}={{CT:1}}\\]</p><p>ידוע כי בסביבה של הנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P={{CT:2}}\\)</span> המשוואה מגדירה פונקציה סתומה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z=f(x,y)\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span>המישור המשיק</div><p>מצאו את משוואת המישור המשיק לגרף <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z=f(x,y)\\)</span> בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle z=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span>נגזרת מעורבת מסדר שני</div><p>חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f''_{xy}({{CT:3}},{{CT:4}})\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle f''_{xy}({{CT:3}},{{CT:4}})=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> גוזרים את הזהות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F(x,y,f(x,y))=0\\)</span> לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> ולפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> ומקבלים את הנגזרות החלקיות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span>, ומהן את המישור המשיק (סעיף א׳). גזירה נוספת לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> נותנת את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f''_{xy}\\)</span> (סעיף ב׳).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הנגזרות מסדר ראשון</b><br>נסמן ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F(x,y,z)\\)</span> את ההפרש בין אגף שמאל לאגף ימין של המשוואה. מאחר ש־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(z=f(x,y)\\)</span>, מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F(x,y,f(x,y))=0\\)</span>.<br>נגזור לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> ולפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle F'_x+F'_z f'_x=0\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle F'_y+F'_z f'_y=0\\]</p>בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F'_z(P)=1\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F'_x(P)={{CT:5}}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F'_y(P)={{CT:6}}\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle f'_x({{CT:3}},{{CT:4}})={{CT:7}}\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle f'_y({{CT:3}},{{CT:4}})={{CT:8}}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — המישור המשיק (סעיף א׳)</b><br>לכן המישור המשיק הוא<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle z={{CT:9}}+{{CT:7}}(x-{{CT:3}})+{{CT:8}}(y-{{CT:4}})={{CT:10}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — הנגזרת המעורבת (סעיף ב׳)</b><br>כעת נגזור לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> את הזהות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F'_x+F'_z f'_x=0\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle F''_{xy}+F''_{xz}f'_y+F''_{yz}f'_x+F''_{zz}f'_x f'_y+F'_z f''_{xy}=0 \\]</p>בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F''_{xy}(P)={{CT:11}}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F''_{xz}(P)={{CT:12}}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F''_{yz}(P)={{CT:13}}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F''_{zz}(P)={{CT:14}}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F'_z(P)=1\\)</span>. לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle f''_{xy}({{CT:3}},{{CT:4}}) = -\\left( {{CT:11}}+{{CT:12}}\\cdot{{CT:8}}+{{CT:13}}\\cdot{{CT:7}}+{{CT:14}}\\cdot{{CT:7}}\\cdot{{CT:8}} \\right) = {{CT:15}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:pplane]] [[feedback:papprox]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "papprox", "value": 0.55, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "tans2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "papprox-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b> הנגזרת המעורבת חושבה נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "papprox-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> גזרו לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F'_x+F'_z f'_x=0\\)</span>. אל תשכחו שגם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F'_x\\)</span> וגם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F'_z\\)</span> תלויות ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x,y,z\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "pplane", "value": 0.45, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pplane-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b> משוואת המישור המשיק נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pplane-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> השתמשו ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F'_x+F'_z f'_x=0\\)</span> וב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(F'_y+F'_z f'_y=0\\)</span>, ואז כתבו את המישור המשיק.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["A", "B", "C", "D", "E", "F", "Fleft", "Fraw", "Fright", "G", "H", "K", "L", "Ptuple", "X", "Y", "Z", "c000", "c001", "c002", "c003", "c010", "c011", "c020", "c030", "c100", "c101", "c110", "c200", "c210", "c300", "case1", "case2", "case3", "case4", "cfg", "configs", "cubic", "extra", "fam", "fx0", "fxy0", "fy0", "fzz0", "negside", "plane", "posside", "tans1", "tans2", "x0", "y0", "z0"], "nvariants": 50}